{"book":"1-kings","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T08:03:32.329367239Z","verse":15,"ref":"1-kings 6:15","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":6,"translation":"And he built ⟨את⟩ the walls of the house inside with cedar side-pieces, from the floor of the house to the walls of the ceiling — ⟨he⟩ overlaid wood inside — and he overlaid ⟨את⟩ the floor of the house with cypress side-pieces.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויבן","gloss":"And he built"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the walls"},{"surface":"קירות","gloss":"the walls"},{"surface":"הבית","gloss":"of the house"},{"surface":"מביתה","gloss":"inside"},{"surface":"בצלעות","gloss":"with panels"},{"surface":"ארזים","gloss":"of cedar"},{"surface":"מקרקע","gloss":"from the floor"},{"surface":"הבית","gloss":"of the house"},{"surface":"עד","gloss":"to"},{"surface":"קירות","gloss":"the walls"},{"surface":"הספן","gloss":"of the ceiling"},{"surface":"צפה","gloss":"⟨he⟩ overlaid"},{"surface":"עץ","gloss":"wood"},{"surface":"מבית","gloss":"inside"},{"surface":"ויצף","gloss":"and he overlaid"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the floor"},{"surface":"קרקע","gloss":"the floor"},{"surface":"הבית","gloss":"of the house"},{"surface":"בצלעות","gloss":"with panels"},{"surface":"ברושים","gloss":"of cypress"}]}